~ start

Aunt Stephanie: [STEPHANIE GREETING -- warm, busy mechanic, acknowledges the player docking in or hailing]
- Ask about repairs.
	do repairs_started = station.begin_repairs(player)
	if repairs_started
		Aunt Stephanie: [STEPHANIE REPAIR ACCEPT -- family doesn't pay, ship's getting fixed]
	else
		Aunt Stephanie: [STEPHANIE REPAIR REFUSAL -- can't work on you from way out there, dock with me first]
	=> start
- [RESPONSE PLACEHOLDER -- ask Stephanie about checking on Todd] [if not story.has_flag("todd_mission_accepted") /]
	do story.set_flag("todd_mission_accepted")
	do missions.start_mission_by_id("check_on_todd")
	Aunt Stephanie: [STEPHANIE MISSION PITCH -- worried, Todd hasn't called, asks player to fly out and check on him]
	Aunt Stephanie: [STEPHANIE MISSION ACCEPTANCE -- thanks the player, tells them where to start looking]
	=> start
- [RESPONSE PLACEHOLDER -- ask Stephanie for a status update on Todd] [if story.has_flag("todd_mission_accepted") /]
	Aunt Stephanie: [STEPHANIE STATUS REMINDER -- still owes her a visit to Todd's place, hasn't heard back yet]
	=> start
- Goodbye.
	=> END
